# salt-radar port of btop++'s nord.theme
# (https://github.com/aristocratos/btop, Apache-2.0)
#
# Bashtop theme with nord palette (https://www.nordtheme.com)
# by Justin Zobel <justin.zobel@gmail.com>
#
# The status, pulse and highlight colors salt-radar adds come from the Nord
# palette too: aurora for status, frost for highlights.

